:"掌書記是唐代節度使或地方官員的幕僚職位，負責文書起草和記錄，此處崔從長作為李同捷的掌書記，被派遣奉表入朝，體現其在處理外交文書中的作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"遣掌書記崔從長奉表","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"200ea74d-514f-440d-9b85-122cd9aeb840"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"李同捷，横海节度使李全略之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009676","link_td_number_id":799423,"people_name":"李同捷","people_name_jianti_auto":"李同捷","people_xingming":"李同捷","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3ba262d-db0e-11ef-aaff-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"李同捷，横海节度使李全略之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009676","link_td_number_id":799423,"people_name":"同捷","people_name_jianti_auto":"同捷","people_xingming":"李同捷","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"c3ba262f-db0e-11ef-8ce3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"崔從長","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔从长","people_xingming":"崔从长","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2630-db0e-11ef-83d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"同志","people_name_jianti_auto":"同志","people_xingming":"李同志","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2631-db0e-11ef-a0ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"同巽","people_name_jianti_auto":"同巽","people_xingming":"李同巽","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2632-db0e-11ef-b9d6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"c3ba2628-db0e-11ef-a51c-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xùn","source_anchor_text":"弟同志同巽俱入見請","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":51,"text":"巽","tongjian_id":"44431c52-74ae-5def-a816-c8b1fefeaefb"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"滄景","place_name_jianti_auto":"沧景","resolved_place_entity_id":1949,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c3ba262e-db0e-11ef-9b18-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"2李同捷擅據滄景，朝廷經歲不問。同捷冀易世之後或加恩貸，三月，壬戌朔，遣掌書記崔從長奉表與其弟同志、同巽俱入見，請遵朝旨。","content_fanyi":"李同捷擅自占据沧景，朝廷过了整整一年也不加过问。李同捷希望改换天子之后或许能对他加恩宽免，于是在三月壬戌朔这一天，派掌书记崔从长带着他呈给皇上的奏表，与他的弟弟李同志、李同巽一起入朝觐见天子，请求遵从朝廷的旨意。","content_jianti_auto":"2李同捷擅据沧景，朝廷经岁不问。同捷冀易世之后或加恩贷，三月，壬戌朔，遣掌书记崔从长奉表与其弟同志、同巽俱入见，请遵朝旨。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24693,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2628-db0e-11ef-a51c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"宰相","official_note":"宰相是唐代最高行政长官，负责辅佐皇帝处理国家政务，此处指在朝议中与皇帝讨论政事。","official_rank":"正一品至正三品","source_snippet":"與宰相議事已定","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c9c842fb-f3af-4f7c-859b-ac81744a7e02"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韋處厚","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦处厚","people_xingming":"韦处厚","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2636-db0e-11ef-a440-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"延英","place_name_jianti_auto":"延英","resolved_place_entity_id":988,"start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2637-db0e-11ef-863d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3上雖虛懷聽納而不能堅決，與宰相議事已定，尋復中變。夏，四月，丙辰，韋處厚於延英極論之，因請避位；上再三慰勞之。","content_fanyi":"皇上虽然虚心听取并采纳臣下的意见，却不能坚定决断，与宰相商议事情已经定下，不久又中途改变。夏季四月丙辰日，韦处厚在延英殿极力陈论此事，并因此请求退位；皇上再三慰劳他。","content_jianti_auto":"3上虽虚怀听纳而不能坚决，与宰相议事已定，寻复中变。夏，四月，丙辰，韦处厚于延英极论之，因请避位；上再三慰劳之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24694,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2633-db0e-11ef-bdd6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"忠武節度使","official_note":"忠武節度使是唐代地方军事和行政长官，掌管忠武军辖区，此处表示王沛去世。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"忠武節度使王沛薨","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"f07d38ff-10aa-433b-919a-33195a0f9f54"},{"confidenc