州【河北省定州市】","resolved_place_entity_id":573,"start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2672-db0e-11ef-b3b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、河间府（卷十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宋仍属沧州。熙宁四年，省入清池，为饶安镇。○浮水城，在州...","context_before":"...移治胡苏城。贞观十二年，又移饶安县治故浮水城，仍属沧州。","source_end_index":213,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6421d5b7-31c5-57e2-8922-597a4e6595cf","source_start_index":173,"source_text":"宝历二年，武宁帅王智兴讨横海叛帅李同捷，其将李君谋绝河，残无隶，降饶安壁。是也。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/三、河间府（卷十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"8李同捷託爲將士所留，不受詔；乙酉，武寧節度使王智興奏請將本軍三萬人，自備五月糧以討同捷，許之。八月，庚子，削同捷官爵，命烏重胤、王智興、康志睦、史憲誠、李載義與義成節度使李聽、義武節度使張璠各帥本軍討之。","content_fanyi":"李同捷托称被将士挽留，不接受诏令；乙酉日，武宁节度使王智兴上奏，请求率领本军三万人，自备五个月粮草讨伐李同捷，得到准许。八月庚子日，朝廷削去李同捷的官爵，命令乌重胤、王智兴、康志睦、史宪诚、李载义及义成节度使李听、义武节度使张璠各自率领本军讨伐他。","content_jianti_auto":"8李同捷托为将士所留，不受诏；乙酉，武宁节度使王智兴奏请将本军三万人，自备五月粮以讨同捷，许之。八月，庚子，削同捷官爵，命乌重胤、王智兴、康志睦、史宪诚、李载义与义成节度使李听、义武节度使张璠各帅本军讨之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24700,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c3ba2663-db0e-11ef-b259-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"李同捷，横海节度使李全略之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009676","link_td_number_id":799423,"people_name":"同捷","people_name_jianti_auto":"同捷","people_xingming":"李同捷","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3bc6ff7-db0e-11ef-8b97-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李載義","people_name_jianti_auto":"李载义","people_xingming":"李载义","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"c3bc6ff9-db0e-11ef-b181-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":59,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c3bc6ff8-db0e-11ef-bb92-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"同捷遣其子弟以珍玩、女妓賂河北諸鎭。戊午，李載義執其姪，幷所賂獻之。","content_fanyi":"李同捷派自己的儿子和侄子用珍玩、歌妓向河北各藩镇行贿。戊午日，幽州节度使李载义捉住李同捷的侄子，把他连同贿赂物品一起献给天子。","content_jianti_auto":"同捷遣其子弟以珍玩、女妓赂河北诸镇。戊午，李载义执其姪，幷所赂献之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24701,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c3bc6ff5-db0e-11ef-aaa2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否继续暗中资助叛军李同捷","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_C3BC8A51DB0E11EF9A95A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"裴度","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴度","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a53-db0e-11ef-bd7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉國公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋国公","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a54-db0e-11ef-be07-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"裴度封晉國公。節度使爲一道之主，故對其屬吏稱之爲使主。使，疏吏翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"裴度封晋国公。节度使为一道之主，故对其属吏称之为使主。使，疏吏翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a52-db0e-11ef-b108-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"裴度","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴度","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a56-db0e-11ef-bd1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋處厚","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦处厚","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a57-db0e-11ef-a8bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"度","people_name_jianti_auto":"度","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a58-db0e-11ef-8940-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"處厚","people_name_jianti_auto":"处厚","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a59-db0e-11ef-b6f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"讀史者以爲裴度於是時耄及之矣，韋處厚較聰明；不惟不知度，亦不知處厚矣。一推心以待之，一明法以示之，此正寬嚴相濟，所以制御強藩。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"读史者以为裴度于是时耄及之矣，韦处厚较聪明；不惟不知度，亦不知处厚矣。一推心以待之，一明法以示之，此正宽严相济，所以制御强藩。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a55-db0e-11ef-bf0e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"中書","official_note":"中書是唐代中央官署，负责起草诏令和决策，此处指史憲誠的親吏前往中書请事，反映了中書在政务处理中的核心作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"至中書請事","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"40cca827-b0f9-4168-ad13-211a7ee5b141"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"史宪诚，本奚族人，后赐姓史，建康军（今甘肃省高台县东南）人，史周洛之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009670","link_td_number_id":795694,"people_name":"史憲誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"史宪诚","people_xingming":"史宪诚","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae04-db0e-11ef-a8a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李全略","people_name_jianti_auto":"李全略","people_xingming":"李全略","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae05-db0e-11ef-8fa1-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[王日简•李同捷之父]"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"李同捷，横海节度使李全略之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009676","link_td_number_id":799423,"people_name":"同捷","people_name_jianti_auto":"同捷","people_xingming":"李同捷","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae06-db0e-11ef-87bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":765,"link_death_year":839,"link_td_description":"裴度，字中立，河东闻喜县人，出自河东裴氏东眷裴。中晚唐时宪宗、穆宗、敬宗、文宗四朝重臣，官至中书令。","link_td_id":"Q10008124","link_td_number_id":103758,"people_name":"裴度","people_name_jianti_auto":"裴度","people_xingming":"裴度","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae07-db0e-11ef-acb3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"史宪诚，本奚族人，后赐姓史，建康军（今甘肃省高台县东南）人，史周洛之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009670","link_td_number_id":795694,"people_name":"憲誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"宪诚","people_xingming":"史宪诚","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae08-db0e-11ef-977e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"史宪诚，本奚族人，后赐姓史，建康军（今甘肃省高台县东南）人，史周洛之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009670","link_td_number_id":795694,"people_name":"憲誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"宪诚","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae09-db0e-11ef-aead-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韋處厚","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦处厚","people_xingming":"韦处厚","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae0a-db0e-11ef-bc11-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":765,"link_death_year":839,"link_td_description":"裴度，字中立，河东闻喜县人，出自河东裴氏东眷裴。中晚唐时宪宗、穆宗、敬宗、文宗四朝重臣，官至中书令。","link_td_id":"Q10008124","link_td_number_id":103758,"people_name":"晉公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋公","people_xingming":"裴度","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae0b-db0e-11ef-99bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"處厚","people_name_jianti_auto":"处厚","people_xingming":"韦处厚","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae0c-db0e-11ef-925d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"史宪诚，本奚族人，后赐姓史，建康军（今甘肃省高台县东南）人，史周洛之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009670","link_td_number_id":795694,"people_name":"憲誠","people_name_jianti_auto":"宪诚","people_xingming":"史宪诚","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae0d-db0e-11ef-b7e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"李同捷，横海节度使李全略之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009676","link_td_number_id":799423,"people_name":"同捷","people_name_jianti_auto":"同捷","people_xingming":"李同捷","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae0e-db0e-11ef-9322-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"史憲誠與李全略爲婚姻，及同捷叛，密以糧助之。裴度不知其所爲，謂憲誠無貳心。憲誠遣親吏至中書請事，韋處厚謂曰：「晉公於上前以百口保爾使主；處厚則不然，但仰俟所爲，自有朝典耳！」憲誠懼，不敢復與同捷通。","content_fanyi":"魏博节度使史宪诚与李同捷之父李全略本为姻亲，待李同捷反叛朝廷，史宪诚暗中运粮接济他。裴度不知这些实情，以为史宪诚没有异心。史宪诚派亲信僚属到中书门下请示事务，韦处厚对他说：“晋公在皇上面前拿全家上百口人的性命为你的节度使主人作保；我韦处厚却不这样，只等着看他的行事，朝廷自有法纪制裁他！”史宪诚听说后心生恐惧，不敢再与李同捷往来。","content_jianti_auto":"史宪诚与李全略为婚姻，及同捷叛，密以粮助之。裴度不知其所为，谓宪诚无贰心。宪诚遣亲吏至中书请事，韦处厚谓曰：「晋公于上前以百口保尔使主；处厚则不然，但仰俟所为，自有朝典耳！」宪诚惧，不敢复与同捷通。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":24702,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c3bc8a51-db0e-11ef-9a95-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"是否联合沙陀以对抗朝廷","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_C3BCAE0FDB0E11EFB37BA0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"是否接受王庭凑的联合请求","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_C3BCAE0FDB0E11EFB37BA0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"節鉞","official_note":"節鉞是古代授予将领的符节和斧钺，象征军事指挥权，此处王庭湊为同捷请求此官职以增强其权威，但未获批准。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"王庭湊爲同捷求節鉞不獲","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"3bb4422a-f82b-41ff-af52-66a0d96e9427"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":834,"link_td_description":"王廷凑，一作王庭凑，唐代回纥阿布思族，军人，拥兵自立为成德节度使。","link_td_id":"Q10002496","link_td_number_id":794540,"people_name":"王庭湊","people_name_jianti_auto":"王庭凑","people_xingming":"王庭凑","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae13-db0e-11ef-8fde-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":829,"link_td_description":"李同捷，横海节度使李全略之子。","link_td_id":"Q10009676","link_td_number_id":799423,"people_name":"同捷","people_name_jianti_auto":"同捷","people_xingming":"李同捷","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae14-db0e-11ef-822e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"朱邪执宜，沙陀人。朱邪尽忠之子。","link_td_id":"Q10010184","link_td_number_id":966778,"people_name":"朱邪","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱邪","people_xingming":"朱邪执宜","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae16-db0e-11ef-a3c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"朱邪执宜，沙陀人。朱邪尽忠之子。","link_td_id":"Q10010184","link_td_number_id":966778,"people_name":"執宜","people_name_jianti_auto":"执宜","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"c3bcae17-db0e-11ef-af3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"朱邪执宜，沙陀人。朱邪尽忠之子。","link_td_id":"Q10010184","link_td_number_id":966778,"people_name":"執宜","people_name_jianti_auto":"执宜","people_xingming":"朱邪